---
import { forensicMethodology } from '../data/content';
---

<section id="metodologia" class="forensic-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header fade-up text-center">
      <span class="badge badge-gold">RIGOR CIENTÍFICO & PROBATORIO</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Metodología de Investigación Forense <br />
        <span class="gold-text">& Cadena de Custodia</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="gold-divider-center"></div>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        En situaciones de fraude, disputas entre socios o litigios judiciales, la validez de la prueba depende de su inmutabilidad. Aplicamos estándares probatorios avalados por el Código General del Proceso (Ley 1564 de 2012).
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Línea de Fases Metodológicas -->
    <div class="methodology-timeline">
      {forensicMethodology.map((phase) => (
        <div class="timeline-step fade-up">
          <div class="step-indicator">
            <div class="step-circle">
              <span>{phase.step}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="step-connector"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="step-card card-premium">
            <div class="step-header">
              <span class="step-sub">{phase.subtitle}</span>
              <h3 class="step-title">{phase.title}</h3>
            </div>

            <p class="step-desc">{phase.description}</p>

            <div class="step-deliverable">
              <span class="deliv-label">Entregable de Fase:</span>
              <span class="deliv-text">{phase.deliverable}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Garantía de Confidencialidad y Secreto Profesional -->
    <div class="confidentiality-notice fade-up">
      <div class="confidential-icon">
        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B89B5E" stroke-width="2">
          <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
          <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="confidential-text">
        <h4>Compromiso Inquebrantable de Secreto Profesional</h4>
        <p>
          Toda investigación forense o peritaje se inicia bajo la firma obligatoria de acuerdos de confidencialidad reforzada (NDA). Su información estratégica, libros de comercio y registros contables permanecen estrictamente custodiados bajo el secreto profesional consagrado en el artículo 74 de la Constitución Política y la Ley 43 de 1990.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .forensic-section {
    padding: 90px 0;
    background: transparent;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .text-center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-header {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .section-title {
      font-size: 3.1rem;
    }
  }

  .gold-text {
    color: var(--color-gold-champagne);
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    color: #556677;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* Cronograma de Fases */
  .methodology-timeline {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.8rem;
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
  }

  .timeline-step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 50px 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .timeline-step {
      grid-template-columns: 70px 1fr;
      gap: 2.2rem;
    }
  }

  .step-indicator {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .step-circle {
    width: 46px;
    height: 46px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary-dark), #244C73);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-gold-champagne);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(22, 58, 95, 0.25);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .step-circle {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }
  }

  .step-connector {
    flex: 1;
    width: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--color-gold-champagne), rgba(22, 58, 95, 0.15));
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-step:last-child .step-connector {
    display: none;
  }

  .step-card {
    padding: 2rem 2.4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  .step-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .step-sub {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-gold-champagne);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .step-title {
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .step-desc {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: #4C5D6E;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .step-deliverable {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-ivory);
    padding: 0.8rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-gold-champagne);
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .step-deliverable {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }
  }

  .deliv-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .deliv-text {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #8E7238;
  }

  /* Aviso de Confidencialidad */
  .confidentiality-notice {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 3.5rem auto 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(22, 58, 95, 0.03) 0%, rgba(184, 155, 94, 0.06) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(184, 155, 94, 0.3);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.8rem;
  }

  .confidential-icon {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid rgba(184, 155, 94, 0.4);
    border-radius: 50%;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(22, 58, 95, 0.06);
  }

  .confidential-text h4 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .confidential-text p {
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    color: #556677;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
